ctory selection settlement, never a fabricated pending A or R creation. Actual authority/exclusion/resource support remains required before enablement.\n\nReconcile these in the existing prefix-preserving c4 successor before freezing for complete normal DESIGN review. No extra task, test matrix, provider action, source activation, new scope grant or main change.","body":{"scope":"Selected draft sections and actual byte-domain contracts; exactness directions","snapshot":"d49a9446c9d25d276550081bf380b0d470a5695a821c54fd14a42ecd1c50daf0"}}